        "content": "## Send approved emails\nOnly rows with Stage = Drafted and Approved = Yes, max 15 per run (inbox warm-up). Skips anything opted out, blocked, or on the Suppression tab (İYS opt-outs). Sends plain text from the Workspace inbox, logs the email in HubSpot, then writes Stage = Sent, thread ID and follow-up date back to the sheet. 90 s pause between sends. Every send, skip and quota pause is appended to the Log tab.\n\nTEST MODE: if Settings has a non-empty \"Test Email\", every email (and the HubSpot contact) goes to that address instead of the lead. Clear it before real sending.",
